{
  "title": "MLGeo: Machine Learning in the Geosciences",
  "description": "<p>A curriculum book for Machine Learning in the Geosciences (ESS 469/569, University of Washington): open-source scientific computing, AI-ready geoscience data, classic machine learning, deep learning, reproducible workflows, and working with agentic AI in scientific practice. Published with full French and Spanish editions.</p><p>Course material was developed around University of Washington teaching and largely US / Pacific-Northwest datasets; adopters elsewhere should expect to substitute regional data and institutional context.</p>",
